# Software industry mapping for QMS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/qms/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:release_inspection owl:equivalentClass sw:ReleaseInspection .
legacy:release_inspection_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:releaseInspectionId .
legacy:defect_non_conformance owl:equivalentClass sw:DefectNonConformance .
legacy:defect_non_conformance_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:defectNonConformanceId .
legacy:finds_defect_non_conformance rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:findsDefectNonConformance .
